Package: stomics
Type: Package
Title: R Client SDK for the Stomics.io Spatial Transcriptomics Data Portal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stomics.io", email = "support@stomics.io", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The Allman Institute for Personalized Medicine", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Provides functions to search datasets, retrieve metadata, download
    files, and load spatial transcriptomics data directly into Seurat objects
    from the Stomics.io data portal. Supports API key authentication and caches
    downloaded files locally.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
