RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
    Seurat,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    webmockr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://stomics.io/docs/sdk, https://github.com/ITGA3/stomics-r
BugReports: https://github.com/ITGA3/stomics-r/issues
